  "id": "provocative-testing",
  "term": "provocative testing",
  "definition": "Provocative testing is an ex vivo experimental method for observing how living tissue responds when researchers deliberately apply a controlled challenge, such as a physiological agonist or a possible therapeutic compound. In this source, it refers to watching live tumor cells in intact tissue slices to map their functional reactions under controlled conditions.",
